graph TD
    Start[python main.py] --> Init[Initialize Models & Trackers]
    Init --> Read[sv.process_video reads frame]
    Read --> Callback[Call callback(frame)]
    Callback --> Detect[YOLO Detects Faces]
    Detect --> Track[ByteTrack Assigns IDs]
    Track --> Loop{For each face}
    Loop --> |Crop & Resize| Extract[FaceNet Embedding]
    Extract --> Predict[SVM Prediction]
    Predict --> CheckCondition{Crossed line & Conf >= 87%?}
    CheckCondition -->|Yes| SaveData[Save JPG & append to CSV]
    CheckCondition -->|No| Skip[Skip saving]
    SaveData --> Annotate[Draw Bounding Box & Label]
    Skip --> Annotate
    Annotate --> WriteFrame[Save live.png & write to output video]
    WriteFrame --> Read
